{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24343","headline":"斋戒满夜戏招梦得 · 白居易","name":"斋戒满夜戏招梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纱笼灯下道场前，白日持斋夜坐禅。\n无复更思身外事，未能全尽世间缘。\n明朝又拟亲杯酒，今夕先闻理管弦。\n方丈若能来问疾，不妨兼有散花天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}